    "A red palette reduces glare. Lower the screen brightness too. Field mode, from a park's \"I'm here tonight\", turns this on and dims the screen while it is open, then puts both back.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A red palette reduces glare. Lower the screen brightness too. Field mode, from a park's \"I'm here tonight\", turns this on and dims the screen while it is open, then puts both back."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una paleta roja reduce el deslumbramiento. Baja también el brillo de la pantalla. El modo de campo, desde \"Estoy aquí esta noche\" en un parque, la activa y atenúa la pantalla mientras está abierto; después restaura ambas cosas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A score never confirms that a road or park is open. Park updates may be unavailable. Cached alerts and programs show their update time. Check with the park before traveling, especially when Nyx has not checked alerts.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A score never confirms that a road or park is open. Park updates may be unavailable. Cached alerts and programs show their update time. Check with the park before traveling, especially when Nyx has not checked alerts."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un índice nunca confirma que un camino o un parque estén abiertos. Puede que no haya actualizaciones del parque. Las alertas y los programas guardados muestran su hora de actualización. Consulta con el parque antes de viajar, sobre todo si Nyx no ha revisado las alertas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A sky worth protecting": {
