    "Aerosol optical depth at 550 nm, from the CAMS global forecast (Copernicus Atmosphere Monitoring Service) through Open-Meteo's air-quality service, covers about five days. It is averaged over the dark window: below 0.1 is clear air, 0.1 to 0.25 light haze, 0.25 to 0.5 haze or smoke that makes the Milky Way look faint, and 0.5 or more heavy smoke or haze that hides faint stars. From 0.25 a caveat appears beside the score. Smoke is context, not part of the score. Air-quality data: CAMS via Open-Meteo, CC BY 4.0. You can switch this request off in Your privacy.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aerosol optical depth at 550 nm, from the CAMS global forecast (Copernicus Atmosphere Monitoring Service) through Open-Meteo's air-quality service, covers about five days. It is averaged over the dark window: below 0.1 is clear air, 0.1 to 0.25 light haze, 0.25 to 0.5 haze or smoke that makes the Milky Way look faint, and 0.5 or more heavy smoke or haze that hides faint stars. From 0.25 a caveat appears beside the score. Smoke is context, not part of the score. Air-quality data: CAMS via Open-Meteo, CC BY 4.0. You can switch this request off in Your privacy."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La profundidad óptica de aerosoles a 550 nm, del pronóstico global CAMS (Copernicus Atmosphere Monitoring Service) a través del servicio de calidad del aire de Open-Meteo, cubre unos cinco días. Se promedia sobre el periodo de oscuridad: menos de 0.1 es aire limpio; de 0.1 a 0.25, bruma ligera; de 0.25 a 0.5, bruma o humo que hacen ver tenue la Vía Láctea, y 0.5 o más, humo o bruma densos que ocultan las estrellas débiles. A partir de 0.25 aparece una advertencia junto al índice. El humo es contexto, no forma parte del índice. Datos de calidad del aire: CAMS vía Open-Meteo, CC BY 4.0. Puedes desactivar esta solicitud en Tu privacidad."
          }
        }
      }
    },
