    "Each night you record shines at its park on this map of the sky. Nights in the same season join into a figure of their own. Every entry stays on this iPhone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "device": {
              "ipad": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Each night you record shines at its park on this map of the sky. Nights in the same season join into a figure of their own. Every entry stays on this iPad."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Each night you record shines at its park on this map of the sky. Nights in the same season join into a figure of their own. Every entry stays on this iPhone."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "variations": {
            "device": {
              "ipad": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Cada noche que registras brilla en su parque sobre este mapa del cielo. Las noches de una misma estación se unen en una figura propia. Cada entrada se queda en este iPad."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Cada noche que registras brilla en su parque sobre este mapa del cielo. Las noches de una misma estación se unen en una figura propia. Cada entrada se queda en este iPhone."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each park has an IANA time zone. A night runs from local noon to the following local noon, and “tonight” moves on to the coming evening once the Sun rises. Times shown on detail belong to that park, including changes for daylight saving time. The stars behind each screen are the real sky over that park in the middle of the night's darkness, from the Yale Bright Star Catalogue (Hoffleit and Warren, via NASA HEASARC); they show where the stars are, not whether clouds will hide them.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each park has an IANA time zone. A night runs from local noon to the following local noon, and “tonight” moves on to the coming evening once the Sun rises. Times shown on detail belong to that park, including changes for daylight saving time. The stars behind each screen are the real sky over that park in the middle of the night's darkness, from the Yale Bright Star Catalogue (Hoffleit and Warren, via NASA HEASARC); they show where the stars are, not whether clouds will hide them."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada parque tiene una zona horaria IANA. Una noche va del mediodía local al mediodía local siguiente, y “esta noche” pasa a la tarde siguiente cuando sale el Sol. Las horas que se muestran en el detalle son las del parque, incluidos los cambios de horario de verano. Las estrellas detrás de cada pantalla son el cielo real sobre ese parque a mitad de la oscuridad de la noche, según el Yale Bright Star Catalogue (Hoffleit y Warren, vía NASA HEASARC); muestran dónde están las estrellas, no si las nubes las ocultarán."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each park uses its own local date. Estimates can change when cloud forecasts arrive.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each park uses its own local date. Estimates can change when cloud forecasts arrive."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada parque usa su propia fecha local. Las estimaciones pueden cambiar cuando lleguen los pronósticos de nubes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each star is a night at its park. Brighter stars, darker skies.": {
