            "value": "Luz de luna"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Moonlight contributes 40%, clouds 25%, estimated light pollution 20%, and the length of true darkness 15%. Without a cloud forecast, the other weights are scaled to 100. No true darkness caps a night below 40, and the cap lifts gradually over the first three hours of true darkness.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Moonlight contributes 40%, clouds 25%, estimated light pollution 20%, and the length of true darkness 15%. Without a cloud forecast, the other weights are scaled to 100. No true darkness caps a night below 40, and the cap lifts gradually over the first three hours of true darkness."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La luz de la Luna aporta el 40%, las nubes el 25%, la contaminación lumínica estimada el 20% y la duración de la oscuridad total el 15%. Sin pronóstico de nubes, los demás pesos se escalan a 100. Sin oscuridad total, una noche queda por debajo de 40, y ese límite se levanta poco a poco durante las primeras tres horas de oscuridad total."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Moonlight, clouds, artificial light and the length of darkness become one score. Every estimate tells you what is still unknown.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Moonlight, clouds, artificial light and the length of darkness become one score. Every estimate tells you what is still unknown."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La luz de la Luna, las nubes, la luz artificial y la duración de la oscuridad se convierten en un solo índice. Cada estimación te dice qué sigue sin saberse."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Moonlit hours are lighter and hatched.": {
