    "NASA satellite night lights within %@, compared across parks. The sensor misses much of the blue light of white LEDs, and older and newer data were processed differently, so Nyx shows only the comparison.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NASA satellite night lights within %@, compared across parks. The sensor misses much of the blue light of white LEDs, and older and newer data were processed differently, so Nyx shows only the comparison."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Luces nocturnas captadas por satélites de la NASA en un radio de %@, comparadas entre parques. El sensor no capta buena parte de la luz azul de los LED blancos, y los datos antiguos y recientes se procesaron de forma distinta, así que Nyx solo muestra la comparación."
          }
        }
      }
    },
