    "Nyx can set an alarm on this iPhone for a moment in the night, like the Milky Way's core rising, so you can rest until the sky is ready. Alarms ring through Silent and Focus. Nothing leaves this phone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
