    "Open-Meteo forecasts cover up to 16 days. Many parks share one request, using park coordinates only. Clouds are averaged over the complete window of true darkness; on nights without it, over sunset to sunrise, or 10 PM to 2 AM local time under the midnight sun. Forecasts older than 36 hours or with incomplete coverage are treated as unavailable. Weather data: Open-Meteo, CC BY 4.0. License: creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open-Meteo forecasts cover up to 16 days. Many parks share one request, using park coordinates only. Clouds are averaged over the complete window of true darkness; on nights without it, over sunset to sunrise, or 10 PM to 2 AM local time under the midnight sun. Forecasts older than 36 hours or with incomplete coverage are treated as unavailable. Weather data: Open-Meteo, CC BY 4.0. License: creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los pronósticos de Open-Meteo cubren hasta 16 días. Muchos parques comparten una sola solicitud, que solo usa las coordenadas de los parques. Las nubes se promedian sobre todo el periodo de oscuridad total; en noches sin ella, de la puesta a la salida del sol, o de 10 p.m. a 2 a.m. hora local bajo el sol de medianoche. Los pronósticos de más de 36 horas o con cobertura incompleta se consideran no disponibles. Datos meteorológicos: Open-Meteo, CC BY 4.0. Licencia: creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/."
          }
        }
      }
    },
