    "Step-free notes come from each park's accessibility pages on nps.gov, retrieved October 5, 2026. A spot is marked only where an official page says so, and each note shows the sentence it rests on and a link to the page, which opens in Safari. Spots without an official statement show nothing. Night access, gates and seasonal closures are not covered. Conditions change; check with the park.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Step-free notes come from each park's accessibility pages on nps.gov, retrieved October 5, 2026. A spot is marked only where an official page says so, and each note shows the sentence it rests on and a link to the page, which opens in Safari. Spots without an official statement show nothing. Night access, gates and seasonal closures are not covered. Conditions change; check with the park."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las notas sobre acceso sin escalones vienen de las páginas de accesibilidad de cada parque en nps.gov, consultadas el 5 de octubre de 2026. Un punto solo se marca cuando una página oficial lo dice, y cada nota muestra la frase en la que se basa y un enlace a la página, que se abre en Safari. Los puntos sin una declaración oficial no muestran nada. No se cubren el acceso nocturno, los portones ni los cierres de temporada. Las condiciones cambian; consulta con el parque."
          }
        }
      }
    },
