          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El índice"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The score is a planning guide, not a guarantee of visibility or safe access.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The score is a planning guide, not a guarantee of visibility or safe access."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El índice es una guía para planear, no una garantía de visibilidad ni de acceso seguro."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The shape of the night": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The shape of the night"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La forma de la noche"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The time river, each calendar month and the shape of the night offer an audio graph: choose Audio Graph in the rotor to hear the nights rise and fall as a tone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The time river, each calendar month and the shape of the night offer an audio graph: choose Audio Graph in the rotor to hear the nights rise and fall as a tone."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El río del tiempo, cada mes del calendario y la forma de la noche ofrecen una gráfica de audio: elige Gráfica de audio en el rotor para oír cómo suben y bajan las noches en un tono."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The tone falls as the sky darkens and rises toward dawn. It softens while the Moon is up, more for a fuller Moon. A rising pulse is moonrise, a falling pulse moonset, and a chime the Milky Way's core rising.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The tone falls as the sky darkens and rises toward dawn. It softens while the Moon is up, more for a fuller Moon. A rising pulse is moonrise, a falling pulse moonset, and a chime the Milky Way's core rising."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El tono baja a medida que el cielo se oscurece y sube hacia el amanecer. Se suaviza mientras la Luna está en el cielo, más cuanto más llena está. Un pulso ascendente es la salida de la Luna; uno descendente, la puesta de la Luna, y una campanada, la salida del núcleo de la Vía Láctea."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These nights have passed. Look ahead to the next new moon.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These nights have passed. Look ahead to the next new moon."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estas noches ya pasaron. Mira hacia la próxima luna nueva."
          }
        }
      }
    },
