    "With Differentiate Without Color, Excellent and Pristine nights are drawn as small stars, the river's best nights are marked with a triangle, moonlit hours are hatched and past nights are struck through.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With Differentiate Without Color, Excellent and Pristine nights are drawn as small stars, the river's best nights are marked with a triangle, moonlit hours are hatched and past nights are struck through."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Con Diferenciar sin color, las noches Excelentes y Prístinas se dibujan como estrellas pequeñas, las mejores noches del río se marcan con un triángulo, las horas con Luna se ven rayadas y las noches pasadas aparecen tachadas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
